# The release keystore IS committed on purpose. Every APK must be signed with the
# same key or Android refuses to update an installed app in place — so it lives
# in the repo rather than in a secret that can silently go missing. Private repo;
# the password is documented in app/build.gradle.kts.
!credentials/gt7.keystore

